 \"Purpose: crawl from a seed URL with a bounded queue, URL de-dupe, domain limits, optional robots.txt checks, delay, HTML link discovery, main-content extraction, and JSONL output. Use this for small-to-medium site discovery jobs, not for high-volume distributed scraping. Key args: start_url required; max_pages default 20; max_depth default 2; same_domain default true; allowed_domains optional; include_patterns / exclude_patterns optional regex or literal filters; respect_robots default true; delay_ms default 250; render_mode is http|auto|browser (default http; auto retries likely JS apps with Playwright); browser_wait_ms default 500; output_path optional .jsonl; sandbox_dir optional. Example: crawl_site({\\\"start_url\\\":\\\"https://example.com/docs\\\",\\\"max_pages\\\":30,\\\"max_depth\\\":2})\"\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-3d-animation\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 把故事创意转成角色、场景、镜头、动作与合成一致的 3D 动画短片制作方案。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-anime-pv\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 为动画、游戏或虚拟 IP 设计短篇 PV，包括卖点提炼、分镜、节奏、音乐方向与生成执行清单。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-anime-style-forge\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 将角色与场景锻造成一致的原创动画视觉体系，覆盖线条、比例、上色、材质和镜头规则。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-audiobook\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 将书稿组织为多角色有声书制作包，覆盖脚本清理、选角、表演、环境声、章节与质检。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-beat-sync-edit\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 按音乐结构、拍点与情绪变化设计镜头卡点、速度变化和声音衔接。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-brand-film\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 把品牌策略和产品卖点转成可执行的品牌宣传片、产品广告与多渠道视觉资产。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-brand-flow-mg\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 基于品牌标志、IP 与主题制作流线引导、节点连接和标志收束的 MG 动效。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-broll-planner\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 把口播逐字稿拆成可审片的 B-roll 镜头、素材来源、时长和覆盖关系。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-character-performance\n    - generic: 已启用\n    - generic: 根据角色图、剧本与情绪设计自然的微表情、视线、呼吸和肢体表演提示。\n    - switch\n    - generic: creative-cinem